{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:11 2026-10-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:11 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:11 2026-10-19 HKT</p><img alt=\"消防破門入屋救火。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d93523c645081097b43a7a3da32f5ccb/2026-10/888_31.jpg\"/><p>今（19日）中午12時25分，沙田禾輋邨泰和樓一單位冒出濃煙，保安發現報警，消防破門入屋，發現屋內空無一人，懷疑有人煲東西時落了街，忘記熄火引致火警，事件無可疑。</p><img alt=\"消防破門入屋救火。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ef251e4b31cc7cc55341fc530cdc001d/2026-10/10_0_35.jpg\" title=\"消防破門入屋救火。網圖\"/><p>消防破門入屋救火。網圖</p><img alt=\"消防破門入屋救火。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e6baa1fd3dd21a9d251f3cfc5f01d182/2026-10/11_1_31.jpg\" title=\"消防破門入屋救火。網圖\"/><p>消防破門入屋救火。網圖</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T05:19:53.808870+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T05:11:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T09:18:05.819513+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T05:17:34.532380+00:00","content_hash":"64133505d67a0d220f7da6078b0add6aeb3faae67610041884f5eab9e85255fe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}